  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype of hypersexualizing Black women, particularly those who are religious or of a certain age, by focusing on the baseless sexual allegation. This trope is used to demean her character and imply she is sexually deviant, which is a common form of racial and gender-based discrimination.",
